      "sourceBlockId": "block_51",
      "sourceText": "With the Item Upgrade Master Work, an Adventurer may add +1 TO THE ATK ROLL at any time during an Attack and at the time it benefits them the most. This means that they could Exhaust this card to add the bonus after seeing the roll for an Attack.",
